1
00:00:00,302 --> 00:00:02,892
...of a smiley-face sticker
on your homework.

2
00:00:03,889 --> 00:00:06,559
(Jimmy:)- It sounded like a big deal.
- Oh, good Lord.

3
00:00:06,766 --> 00:00:10,896
Are we gonna stand here and listen
to him tear Leonard apart like this?

4
00:00:11,104 --> 00:00:14,104
- Hey, I won a Newcomb medal too.
- My point.

5
00:00:15,692 --> 00:00:18,112
You should've seen this guy
back in the day. Huh?

6
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:20,150
(Jimmy:)He was so little,
he could fit anywhere.

7
00:00:20,363 --> 00:00:22,283
(Jimmy:)Lockers, trash cans.

8
00:00:22,491 --> 00:00:25,371
(Jimmy:)Oh, man,
how did you get inside that backpack?

9
00:00:27,579 --> 00:00:30,999
(Leonard:)Oh, I can't take all the credit.
You helped a lot.

10
00:00:31,208 --> 00:00:35,758
(Jimmy:)- We were practically a comedy team.
- Like the Black Death in Europe.

11
00:00:37,672 --> 00:00:40,382
(Leonard:)Jimmy, I'm kind of curious
why you wanted to see me.

12
00:00:40,592 --> 00:00:43,382
(Jimmy:)Okay, here it is.
I have this great money-making idea.

13
00:00:43,595 --> 00:00:45,845
I need a gear-head
to get it to the finish line.

14
00:00:46,056 --> 00:00:50,516
Mm, technically, Howard's the gear-head.
Leonard's just a dime-store laser jockey.

15
00:00:50,727 --> 00:00:52,017
(Leonard:)What's the idea?

16
00:00:52,646 --> 00:00:54,476
- This is just between us, right?
- Right.

17
00:00:54,689 --> 00:01:00,019
(Jimmy:)Okay. What do you think about a pair of
glasses that makes any movie into 3D?

